# GitHub language statistics (github/linguist)
#
# Notebooks are analysis and reporting artefacts rather than the codebase, and
# their size is dominated by stored cell outputs — base64-encoded chart images —
# not by code. Left undeclared they total ~493 KB against ~206 KB of Python, so
# GitHub reported the repository as mostly Jupyter Notebook.
#
# "linguist-documentation" keeps them out of the language bar while still showing
# them normally in diffs and file listings.
*.ipynb linguist-documentation

# Sample PDFs, ground-truth annotations and pipeline output are inputs and
# results, not source. Linguist already ignores most data formats, but marking
# the directory keeps the classification explicit.
data/** linguist-documentation

# Notebooks are JSON: merging them line by line produces conflicts that are
# painful to resolve by hand and easy to resolve wrongly. Treat them as binary so
# git asks which version to keep instead of interleaving two.
*.ipynb merge=binary
